This package is an unofficial derivative build modified by UniLabOS
contributors in 2026 to support NumPy 2. The changes relax the NumPy runtime
constraint, replace the removed numpy.trapz API with numpy.trapezoid, and use a
static local version for reproducible downstream packaging.

